{
  "item": [
    {
      "id": "fb08bae4-ad3b-4f51-b24d-727411a3b5cd",
      "name": "Daily Stress Routes",
      "description": {
        "content": "The daily stress route includes a summary of the number of minutes the user spends in high stress and high recovery each day. This is a great way to see how your stress and recovery are trending over time. Stress and recovery are mutally exclusive. E.g. one can only be stressed or recovered at any given moement - and cannot be stressed and recovered at the same time.",
        "type": "text/plain"
      },
